814">m-ajută</span></p><p begin="1:39.814" end="1:44.781" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:39.814" end="1:40.435">Să</span> <span begin="1:40.435" end="1:41.677">trec</span> <span begin="1:41.677" end="1:42.918">valea</span> <span begin="1:42.918" end="1:44.781">grea,</span></p><p begin="1:44.781" end="1:49.747" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:44.781" end="1:49.747">Suflare-mprumută-mi</span></p><p begin="1:49.747" end="1:54.714" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:49.747" end="1:51.610">Atât</span> <span begin="1:51.610" end="1:52.231">cât</span> <span begin="1:52.231" end="1:52.851">vei</span> <span begin="1:52.851" end="1:54.714">vrea!</span></p><p begin="1:54.714" end="1:59.680" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:54.714" end="1:55.335">Când</span> <span begin="1:55.335" end="1:57.197">fruntea</span> <span begin="1:57.197" end="1:59.680">plecată</span></p><p begin="1:59.680" end="2:04.647" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:59.680" end="2:00.301">În</span> <span begin="2:00.301" end="2:04.647">moarte-odihnesc,</span></p><p begin="2:04.647" end="2:09.613" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:04.647" end="2:05.268">Să</span> <span begin="2:05.268" end="2:06.509">știi</span> <span begin="2:06.509" end="2:07.751">înc-o</span> <span begin="2:07.751" end="2:09.613">dată:</span></p><p begin="2:09.613" end="2:15.980" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:09.613" end="2:11.476">Isus,</span> <span begin="2:11.476" end="2:12.097">Te</span> <span begin="2:12.097" end="2:15.980">iubesc!</span></p><p begin="2:15.980" end="2:20.922" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:15.980" end="2:18.451">Cunună</span> <span begin="2:18.451" end="2:19.069">de</span> <span begin="2:19.069" end="2:20.922">glorii,</span></p><p begin="2:20.922" end="2:25.863" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:20.922" end="2:22.775">Lumini</span> <span begin="2:22.775" end="2:23.393">voi</span> <span begin="2:23.393" end="2:25.863">purta,</span></p><p begin="2:25.863" end="2:30.805" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:25.863" end="2:26.481">Prin</span> <span begin=